  "verdict": "exploratory_only_not_a_balance_or_fun_approval",
  "method": "Unchanged business and integrated policies, real 8000 kr start; stop the next business-policy iteration after first rank or60business calls. Integrated total includes injected public player choices and is evaluated against60total actions. No browser clicks measured.",
  "limitations": [
    "Early measurements stop before2036; they do not show that human players understand the interface or enjoy the progression.",
    "An integrated injected choice can reach rank before its already planned business call completes; first-rank fields freeze at the actual crossing, while final row day/cash can be later.",
    "Jobs-only control is a separately labelled greedy expected-payoff heuristic capped at90actual days or60actions, using balanced default strategy and no quests, trades or state grants. It is not the historical round6 policy or an optimal player.",
    "Every seed remains in the report, including customs losses and failures to reach rank."
  ],
  "definitions": {
    "firstRankActions": "Completed outer public player actions up to and including the first observed rank >= 1. Nested automatic engine actions and UI navigation are excluded. Injected story decisions in the integrated simulator count separately and also count toward its total.",
    "firstRankDay": "Actual game day on the first completed public action observed at rank >= 1; null if never reached.",
    "firstRankClicks": "Not measured by engine simulations. Always null; actions are not a browser click count.",
    "itemPaths": "Owned item attribution uses actual recorded quest choices mapped to their reward definition. help = help choice, dark = exploit choice; other, unknown or ambiguous evidence remains explicit. No history is invented for imported items."
  },
